                                                        AWS Disaster Recovery
Disaster Recovery strategies:
  1) backup and restore 
  2) pilot light: a small version of the app is always running in the cloud. Useful for the critical core (pilot light). faster than backup and restore as critical system ae already up
  3) warm standy: full system is up and running, but at minimum size. upon disaster we can scale to production load 
  4) hot site / multi site Approach

